<h2 align="start" nodeId="e20b1401f72c475a9151f84a7d7b0ab1">3.4  累计因子排查</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="018113c15af34b7abcbaee08b3bafec8">
<tr nodeId="b064fe94f5ca4e208c084c76df78608b">
<th colwidth="[135]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="3312105b09d4476d9cbbfee90c52045a">
<p nodeId="6253ce18a0e2436e95fea12a15de3d47"><span font-size="14">功能</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[578]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="8cc87b5762d340dcb3614b94f4e683a3">
<p nodeId="6bc01245535549cdb267fff5532e6c3b"><span font-size="14">说明</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[599]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="e19f08088f0e43cc97eb118a080a4492">
<p nodeId="8a9dfcadf8c0479ea1478e26b79a3ab2"><span font-size="14">图例</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="c234f58eba384fe4a67e3fcb035b8123">
<td colwidth="[135]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="52ee31a833ae40189cbb619b73558e78">
<p align="start" nodeId="6e1bbd517ff741ebb11fdefc270af4db"><span font-size="14">累计事件与事件关联</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[578]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="6c89e66f2fca4941844fdae5979adc54">
<p align="start" nodeId="e1ef6f6826dd46b8b8febac8e061ef40"><span font-size="14">1.入口：Zeus-&gt;策略排查-&gt;累计查询</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="f2e5fb6209b84b639ad0ad874f0df436"><span font-size="14">2.配置说明：</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="eab81ffbfbc4472b9acb4c8b6f6b5b2c"><span font-size="14">1）累计查询为将读累计和写累计查询功能集成的入口，支持读累计/写累计查询、实时/离线查询在一个页面切换（后续读累计查询、写累计查询单独入口将逐步下线）。</span></p>
<km-note type="tip" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="95af39af5b994e6f95acfbf00a638ccc">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p align="start" nodeId="8b424501bf7e416eaeb398da7d98e616"><span font-size="14"><strong>读累计查询和写累计查询有什么区别？</strong></span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="86789c8671034f91bfa02534e56f7d6d"><span font-size="14">读累计查询是指按照规则执行时读取到的累计因子值所对应的累计明细详情（实时查询是从当前时点的读累计，离线查询是所选时间点往前推一个累计周期的累计明细详情），写累计查询是指在所选时间段实际被写入的累计明细</span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)"><span font-size="14">，同一个请求读累计和写累计明细可能不同，比如，当次请求不满足读累计条件则读累计明细将为空，但写累计明细可能存在。</span></span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="8fac3ad8d3dd4a0d9fca5c70d8084ac7"><span font-size="14">此外基于成本和查询效率考虑，读写累计明细展示上做了以下限制：</span></p>
<ul nodeId="88c80566327f4dc09b1ae8722052f844">
<li nodeId="9debc35c163641c294bf406cd6dc490a">
<p align="start" nodeId="b1cd1eeaa6f04087b8483cb1a05f4b92"><span font-size="14">读累计实时查询：支持近10条明细返回</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="33ef21d3589540afa030bae29fd6872f">
<p align="start" nodeId="c4d320a0b04d4465a93f523bccef9f78"><span font-size="14">写累计实时查询：支持近4天明细查询</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="da0ae65575dd484bb4964c8d265b95b5">
<p align="start" nodeId="bdfff33bbb2247e0ac14c282919eb3ef"><span font-size="14">读累计离线插叙：支持近1000条数据的查询、支持按照时间点往前推一个累计周期的明细查询</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="c8d8c1e133264c4d83787cabdff100b3">
<p align="start" nodeId="be3a6022aa584cd3ac97d9f40ca40723"><span font-size="14">写累计离线查询：支持近1000条数据的产讯，支持按照时间区间的累计明细查询</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p align="start" nodeId="40ea641118574670a0eaaad43ac7dd6a"><span font-size="14">2）查询明细：</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="1e8613094a0d4a66848409d90c552a04"><span font-size="14">读累计查询查询到的是累计客体的值，以图所示，累计因子</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.84)"><span font-size="14">factor_account_dfpid_login_userid_cnt_5min</span></span><span font-size="14">的key为userid 则累计明细为userid的取值，共1条。</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="4ce076b5832d46dda91ccbacfff2d7c4"><span font-size="14">而写累计查询查询到的是某一事件段写入累计请求的详情。</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="d9377dd6a3544371b9f95407c4c1f03c"><span font-size="14">3）支持读写累计离线查询，最多可支持1000条明细的查询，查询结果请关注【</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="14"><strong>Scorpio累计服务</strong></span></span><span font-size="14">】应用号，查询结果可点击累计明细文件，（</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">注意：只有将累计因子迁移到新新累计服务中的累计因子才支持累计离线查询，累计服务迁移是由研发统一迁移，无需策略操作，迁移前将会主动联系各相关用户。）</span></span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="6a8cfee8c7474ad48b642e7843d27ba4"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1626109941/33131324163?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="" width="556" height="288" nodeId="5584d99407dc449da822b991b186c086" /></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="7ee8fe992dd14909a21f6f982d1cb2e1"><span font-size="14">累计明细中包含以下字段：</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="d7cb11d638bf4d5298919c4455b92312"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1626109941/33131744323?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="" width="556" height="78" nodeId="3cb9b6f4635b4fd0b02ca5ea0a8ccdb0" /></p>
<km-note type="warning" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="699670279fba4d82b6c4eb23151f1026">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p align="start" nodeId="4367ff8f84044687950729f115f19818"><span font-size="14">根据读写累计查询排查累计相关问题时需特别注意累计因子中是否配置了“累计自身”，如果配置了且当次请求满足写累计条件，如果是计数zeus会自动将累计值加1，但如果此次请求不包含在累计事件中，累计明细将不会记录，会出现实际累计明细数和累计结果值相差1的情况。</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[599]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="88312a82eb3142fa8fa9329cb5b29dfa">
